  <metadata>
    <name>Four Mile Trail · Yosemite National Park</name>
    <desc>switchbacks up the south wall of Yosemite Valley to Glacier Point. NPS Public Trails OBJECTID 15283. Surface: Native. Class: Class 3: Developed. Mapping method: unknown. Horizontal accuracy: unknown. Public domain, U.S. National Park Service.</desc>
    <link href="https://mapservices.nps.gov/arcgis/rest/services/NationalDatasets/NPS_Public_Trails/FeatureServer/0"><text>NPS Public Trails</text></link>
